s room.\"\n```","refusal":null,"reasoning":"I'm working out how the decision applies under A-FDT: each copy has its own observations, so my node and the other copy's node are different, and the question is whether the other copy's act descends from mine.\n\nI'm checking whether the other copy's act descends from mine, and since the observations differ by name and lead, it doesn't. Dominance then favors submitting regardless of the prior, so both copies end up submitting.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm working out how the decision applies under A-FDT: each copy has its own observations, so my node and the other copy's node are different, and the question is whether the other copy's act descends from mine.\n\nI'm checking whether the other copy's act descends from mine, and since the observations differ by name and lead, it doesn't. Dominance then favors submitting regardless of the prior, so both copies end up submitting.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9408,"completion_tokens":981,"total_tokens":10389,"cost":0.057252,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.057252,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.037632,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01962},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":385,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}